Third-party components
----------------------

AiMD builds on open-source projects under their own licenses, including
(see `pnpm-lock.yaml` for the full, authoritative list):

  Fastify, Hocuspocus, Yjs, y-indexeddb, postgres.js, React, Vite, CodeMirror 6,
  Tailwind CSS, markdown-it, KaTeX, Mermaid, DOMPurify, fflate, zod,
  @node-rs/argon2, Electron, electron-builder, Capacitor, Playwright, Vitest
      -> MIT / Apache-2.0 / BSD / ISC (permissive)
  Caddy (shipped as a container image in `deploy/docker-compose.yml`)
      -> Apache-2.0
  Postgres 18 with pg_trgm (shipped as a container image)
      -> PostgreSQL License

Bundled artwork (`apps/*/resources`, icon and splash assets) is original work
released under the same MIT license as the code.

No component of this project is distributed under GPL / AGPL / LGPL terms.
